      "type": "text",
      "x": 1090.68,
      "y": 512.5,
      "width": 458.64000000000004,
      "height": 175,
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "PostgreSQL 16 · host port 5433\n\nCustomers · Transactions · Disputes · DisputeStatusHistory\nOutboxMessages · InboxMessages (dispute events)\n\n• one active dispute per transaction (filtered unique index)\n• unique (CustomerId, IdempotencyKey)\n• xmin row version → concurrent edit = 409\n• dispute_number_seq for dispute numbers\n• migrations applied at startup · demo seed in Development only",
      "originalText": "PostgreSQL 16 · host port 5433\n\nCustomers · Transactions · Disputes · DisputeStatusHistory\nOutboxMessages · InboxMessages (dispute events)\n\n• one active dispute per transaction (filtered unique index)\n• unique (CustomerId, IdempotencyKey)\n• xmin row version → concurrent edit = 409\n• dispute_number_seq for dispute numbers\n• migrations applied at startup · demo seed in Development only",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
